  "details": "Currently, when switching avatar, a blue placeholder avatar will be displayed during the loading/download of the new avatar.\n\nInstead of switching to a blue loading avatar with no animation or ik, would it be possible to keep the previous avatar (even if it's the default robot) until the new one is fully ready and then switch to it.\n\nThis would allow people with poor internet connection speed (believe me I tried every option, nothing better is available at my location and I can't afford to move to a new house/apartment just like that) to still be able to interact with people switching to a new avatar as the previous avatar would retain ik/tracking and animations tied to it instead of having to wait up to multiple minutes in front of a blue diamond placeholder.",
